---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Restaurant Night" description="Pack 3472 Restaurant Night fundraiser events at local restaurants in Leawood, KS.">
  <h1 class="page-title">Restaurant Night</h1>
  <hr class="rule" />

  <p>
    Restaurant Night events are fun family fundraisers where Pack 3472 partners with local restaurants to support our
    Pack's activities and adventures. A portion of sales made during our designated event window goes back to our
    Scouts.
  </p>

  <div class="events-box" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <h3>How It Works</h3>
    <p><strong style="color: #cc6600;">1) Watch for announcements.</strong> We'll announce upcoming events by email and at meetings.</p>
    <p><strong style="color: #cc6600;">2) Dine out.</strong> Head to the featured restaurant on event night with family and friends.</p>
    <p><strong style="color: #cc6600;">3) Support Scouting.</strong> A percentage of sales benefits Pack 3472.</p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 14px;">
    Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact our Pack leadership</a> for details on the next fundraiser night.
  </p>
</Layout>
